            "content": "<p>Smart Furniture is <strong>Egypt’s largest furniture factory and one of the largest in the Middle East</strong>, producing <strong>700–800 bedrooms per week</strong>, depending on design, material availability, and production schedule. With <strong>over 2,000 dedicated employees</strong> and <strong>10,000 sq meter of factory space</strong>, we combine <strong>advanced technology, craftsmanship, and expertise</strong> to bring our unique vision to homes and businesses.We are <strong>proud Egyptian manufacturers</strong>. Our <strong>professional Egyptian workforce</strong> has played a <strong>central role in providing the best end-user experience</strong>, including <strong>free installation services</strong> for all customers.We have successfully completed <strong>250 projects in Egypt</strong> and <strong>87 in North America and the Middle East</strong>, demonstrating our expertise and trust on a global scale.<strong>Time Delivery:</strong> For projects, we ship complete orders within <strong>5–7 working days</strong>.<br/><br/></p>"
